avif?t=1744551256\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197160/extras/a5dcb593e8e6c2010989b3c381f4b84c.webm?t=1744551256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197160/extras/a5dcb593e8e6c2010989b3c381f4b84c.mp4?t=1744551256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197160/extras/43469ec32a05cf973c2f62b6ecbf1d8c.avif?t=1744551256\" /></div><br>&quot;Castle of Secrets is a beautiful and enthralling visual novel featuring many interesting quests, mechanics and puzzles, such as crafting items, inventory, camera control and character control in 3d space. Puzzles can be regular, where you have to connect the right items to each other, or these can be mini-games, where you have to think a little differently. As you progress through the game, the complexity of puzzles and quests increases and solving them will not be as easy as at the beginning. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197160/extras/d2a5fa91df37059354a0b0c23c165c39.poster.avif?t=1744551256\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197160/extras/d2a5fa91df37059354a0b0c23c165c39.webm?t=1744551256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197160/extras/d2a5fa91df37059354a0b0c23c165c39.mp4?t=1744551256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br>The game offers a tutorial level that will guide the player through all the its mechanics. Enjoy beautiful graphics and nice animation. Use all the tools that the game offers you to solve the most difficult puzzles and mini-games.&quot;<br><br>The prologue includes:<br>- Tutorial level<br>- 2 